  "body": "The spec has an event handler attribute `onloadstart` but doesn't have an event handler attribute `onloadend`. If this inconsistency is unintentional, it should be fixed. If it is intentional, a non-normative note saying that it is intentional would be helpful.\n\n[Relevant Gecko bug](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1264769)\n",
